{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":49,"count":29,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L14-1-03\",\"住\",\"住\",\"住\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我已經在台北住了三十年了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L14-1-03","sourceFront":"住","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他住的那棟大樓附近有學校，也有餐廳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L14-1-20","sourceFront":"大樓","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這個地方到處都有垃圾，又髒又臭，誰要住在這裡呢？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-2-13","sourceFront":"到處","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我的同學住在我家旁邊，他也是我的鄰居。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-2-18","sourceFront":"鄰居","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"住在這裡很安全，你不用擔心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-2-19","sourceFront":"不用","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他住在五樓，我們上去找他吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L03-1-08","sourceFront":"上去","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這棟公寓除了環境不錯，家具還很新，感覺住起來會很舒服。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-18","sourceFront":"感覺","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我住的社區有一座游泳池，只要有空我就會去游泳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L05-1-25","sourceFront":"游泳池","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在台北市租房子太貴了，住在郊區可以省一點兒錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-11","sourceFront":"省錢","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我喜歡夏天到鄉下去住幾天，那裡比都市涼快多了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L15-1-21","sourceFront":"涼快","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在你的國家，成年的孩子常跟父母住在一起，還是滿十八歲就搬出去了？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-11","sourceFront":"成年","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我住的房子不大，也沒有很多錢，可是家人都很愛我， 讓我覺得很幸福、很滿足。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-17","sourceFront":"滿足","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小歐為了省錢，整個月都吃泡麵，最後吃壞了身體，吃藥、住院花了更多錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-12","sourceFront":"泡麵","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"醫生說那個病人得住院，要是三天以內都沒發燒、頭也不痛了，就可以出院了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-35","sourceFront":"以內","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"爺爺在這棟公寓住了十年了，搬家時，用了好幾個大箱子來裝東西。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-14","sourceFront":"箱子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我覺得住在鄉下除了購物不方便以外，什麼都好","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-19","sourceFront":"以外","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家民宿的地點實在太偏僻了，除了路不好走，附近也沒人住，想找個人問路都難。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-27","sourceFront":"偏僻","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"住在學校宿舍有一些限制，比如說晚上十點前必須回到宿舍。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-22","sourceFront":"限制","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果你想了解臺灣社會的人、事、物，最好親自來臺灣住一段時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-09","sourceFront":"社會","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我住的地方不算偏僻，但是附近沒有公車站，所以自行車成了我最常利用的交通工具。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-20","sourceFront":"成","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我住的地方很偏僻，手機常收不到訊息，朋友很難跟我聯絡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-32","sourceFront":"訊息","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:網友跟我借十萬塊錢，說他的家人生病住院了。 B:你太天真了，他是騙你的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-10","sourceFront":"天真","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這座城市不但交通十分便利，生活水準也很高，大家都想搬來這裡住。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-10","sourceFront":"十分","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那棟公寓自從三年前的一場大火之後，就不適合居住了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-19","sourceFront":"居住","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小年的夢想就是蓋一棟土地面積六十坪、三層樓高的房子，讓全家人都住在一起。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-08","sourceFront":"面積","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"心裡很平靜(peaceful)的人，就算居住在人車又多又吵的市區，仍然覺得自在。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-36","sourceFront":"市區","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"不斷複習生字卡片能幫我們記住新的字。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-35","sourceFront":"記住","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我罵他是因為他太可惡了，你要我別生氣，我真的忍不住。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-13","sourceFront":"忍不住","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我住的地方距離公司很近，省了很多時間與交通費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-27","sourceFront":"距離","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自從住校以後，我得學習自己收拾、整理房間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-58","sourceFront":"收拾","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有的房子前院、後院都有花園，住起來一定很舒服。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-25","sourceFront":"後院","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"當我聽到被公司錄取的消息時，還以為是做夢，忍不住用力捏了自己一下。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-26","sourceFront":"捏","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經過這次手術，得了重病的嬰兒終於順利地保住了生命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-32","sourceFront":"保","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了保住勞工的福利，她到處去演講。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-12","sourceFront":"勞工","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"老方住院開刀時，同事們都輪流到醫院慰問並照顧他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-26","sourceFront":"輪流","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"傳說月亮上住著一隻兔子，這個神話留給孩子們許多想像空間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-04","sourceFront":"傳說","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這道菜味道獨特，香味及顏色也很迷人，讓人忍不住流口水。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-43","sourceFront":"口水","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"潮溼的居住環境不僅使家具不容易保養，並且更可能傷害人體健康。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-19","sourceFront":"潮溼","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 亻(person) rests with the 主(master) → choosing to 住(reside) here."},{"key":"[\"B1L16-3-03\",\"菲律賓\",\"菲律賓\",\"菲律宾\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"夏天時，在臺灣、日本、菲律賓都有颱風，這是很普遍的現象。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-18","sourceFront":"普遍","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果你想到菲律賓旅行，還是帶著美金到當地換錢比較方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-30","sourceFront":"美金","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"A sound-match for 'the Philippines' → 菲律賓(the Philippines)."},{"key":"[\"B3L03-1-30\",\"肩膀\",\"肩膀\",\"肩膀\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"買襯衫的時候得注意肩膀的大小，太大或太小都不合適。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-31","sourceFront":"大小","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"醫生說你肩膀疼的原因，是因為長時間打電腦的關係。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-2-03","sourceFront":"原因","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"何先生的肩膀比較寬，這件襯衫他穿起來太緊了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-14","sourceFront":"寬","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我爺爺年紀大了，不但體力不好，還有頭痛、肩膀痛的毛病","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-08","sourceFront":"毛病","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你穿的這件衣服肩膀寬度很合適，就是長度太長了，要是能改短一些就好了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-10","sourceFront":"寬度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 肩(shoulders) and 膀(shoulder): 肩膀 means shoulder."},{"key":"[\"B3L03-2-13\",\"优惠\",\"優惠\",\"优惠\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"來來來，快來買！我們3C產品的價格最優惠，品質也很好，快把握機會喔！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-13","sourceFront":"優惠","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這家便利商店現在有「咖啡、茶飲買一送一」的優惠活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-01","sourceFront":"茶飲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天百貨公司有優惠活動，買一條床單就送一床被子(quilt)。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-13","sourceFront":"床","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們工廠與那家旅行社有合作關係，廠內員工如果報名他們的旅行團，都可以享受優惠價。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-14","sourceFront":"旅行社","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L04-2-31\",\"早生贵子\",\"早生貴子\",\"早生贵子\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我去參加朋友的婚禮，除了送紅包，還祝福他們事事如意、早生貴子、永遠幸福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-31","sourceFront":"早生貴子","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L08-2-14\",\"自信\",\"自信\",\"自信\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"小畢本來認為自己的書法寫得很好，但是上次比賽輸了以後，他就失去自信了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-14","sourceFront":"自信","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"父母除了教導孩子做人做事的道理，也應該肯定他們的表現，讓他們更有自信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-08","sourceFront":"教導","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我覺得馬小姐找不到工作的原因不是自己的條件不夠好，是他太缺乏自信了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-17","sourceFront":"缺乏","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"電影明星一向很重視自己的穿著，合適的穿著才能讓他們更有品味、更有自信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-05","sourceFront":"一向","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"出國留學有不少好處，例如打開視野、增加自信、提高外文程度等等。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-20","sourceFront":"例如","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在表演以前準備得越多，上舞臺就越有自信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-46","sourceFront":"舞台","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有朋友與家人的鼓勵，使他在面對任何困難時都十分自信。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-47","sourceFront":"自信","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 自(self) and 信(trust): 自信 means self-confidence."},{"key":"[\"B3L10-1-16\",\"溝通\",\"溝通\",\"沟通\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"每個人的想法、看法都不一樣，要是遇到意見不同時，就應該好好地溝通。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-16","sourceFront":"溝通","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"佳佳認為談戀愛的對象，年齡不重要，容不容易溝通、個性適不適合才是最重要的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-24","sourceFront":"年齡","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"與人溝通時，最重要的是讓對方清楚了解你想表達的意思。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-04","sourceFront":"與","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果同事之間不願意溝通，這個會議怎麼開下去呢？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-21","sourceFront":"下去","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有時候孩子不明白自己到底犯了什麼錯，父母應該好好跟他們溝通。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-10","sourceFront":"犯錯","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人類的智慧表現在思考、溝通、欣賞、創造等方面。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-04","sourceFront":"智慧","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"由於每個人看事情的角度不同，所以得溝通才能避免誤會","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-10","sourceFront":"角度","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"幸福的婚姻不僅需要觀念的溝通，更需要感情的交流。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-45","sourceFront":"婚姻","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Clearing the 溝(ditch) channel so dialogue flows 通(through) between both sides: 溝通 means communicate."},{"key":"[\"B3L13-2-21\",\"暫時\",\"暫時\",\"暂时\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"鄰居有急事得出門處理，請我暫時幫他照顧孩子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-21","sourceFront":"暫時","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"看電影時，如果要暫時離開座位，記得把重要物品帶在身上。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-09","sourceFront":"物品","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為學校缺乏經費，宿舍的電腦設備暫時沒辦法改善。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-17","sourceFront":"經費","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"碰到困難無法繼續前進時，暫時後退等待機會也是一種作法。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-21","sourceFront":"後退","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"時間有時能消除煩惱，不能解決的事就暫時放在一邊吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-47","sourceFront":"消除","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我最近皮膚又紅又癢，暫時不能吃太辣或太鹹的食物。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-53","sourceFront":"癢","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他現在的身體狀況很糟，請暫時先別去探他的病。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-01","sourceFront":"探病","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 暫(temporary) and 時(time): 暫時 means temporarily."},{"key":"[\"B4L03-2-17\",\"倉庫\",\"倉庫\",\"仓库\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"小王對農業很有興趣，家裡的倉庫擺滿了種田用的工具。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-17","sourceFront":"倉庫","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L09-1-39\",\"排\",\"排\",\"排\",\"M\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我逛街時經過了一排小吃攤，就買幾樣回來當作宵夜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-39","sourceFront":"排","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"每年安排一段時間去旅行，說不定能帶給你更豐富的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-20","sourceFront":"說不定","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"參加旅行團或自助旅遊各有各的優點，懶得自己安排行程的人，就跟著導遊走吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-12","sourceFront":"旅行團","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那家工廠排出的廢氣很毒，附近已經有不少民眾生病了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-52","sourceFront":"毒","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"工廠排水系統得設計好，以免汙染自然環境。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-48","sourceFront":"排","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我考慮接受公司的安排，到國外協助市場調查工作。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-32","sourceFront":"考慮","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"週末的時候，火車站的賣票窗口總是排滿了人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-32","sourceFront":"窗口","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"自從有了抽號機以後，人們就不需要站著排隊了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-13","sourceFront":"抽號機","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"今天客人跟著小溫去參觀工廠，也試用了新產品，一切安排都令他十分滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-24","sourceFront":"一切","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"只要照溫老師安排的課程，多閱讀、多練習，你的中文就會有很大的進步。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-03","sourceFront":"進步","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"張經理今天的工作行程安排得很滿，連吃飯、休息的時間都沒有。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-2-14","sourceFront":"滿","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"華語中心除了有培養學生中文能力的課程，還安排了文化課，讓課程更豐富。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-32","sourceFront":"培養","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"顏先生對吃、喝都很講究，吃牛排時應該喝什麼酒，他也很有研究。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-1-11","sourceFront":"講究","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"現在突然下起了大雨，我們的計畫被破壞了，恐怕今天所有的活動都必須重新安排。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-18","sourceFront":"重新","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"公司很重視員工的身心健康，每年都安排一連五天的環島旅行，家人也可以參加。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-19","sourceFront":"身心","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"這個週末你有什麼安排？要不要一起去看電影？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-02","sourceFront":"安排","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"雖然我排隊排了一個小時才買到跨年演唱會的票，可是很值得。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-27","sourceFront":"值得","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"你只買了一份雞排，吃得飽嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-21","sourceFront":"飽","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"炸雞排是我最喜歡的小吃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-1-15","sourceFront":"雞排","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"火車應該快到了，我們去前面排隊吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-22","sourceFront":"應該","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"捷運站的洗手間外面有很多人在排隊，你要去嗎？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L16-2-06","sourceFront":"廁所","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"公園的音樂晚會快要開始了，可不可以請你們幫我排那些椅子？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L15-3-09","sourceFront":"排","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"現在坐捷運的人很多，我們需要排隊。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L13-2-02","sourceFront":"排隊","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那家工廠排出的黑煙不只氣味難聞，更可怕的是可能對肺部造成傷害。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-14","sourceFront":"煙","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"學校安排我們到鄉下當「一日農民」，體驗農夫的辛苦。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-40","sourceFront":"農民","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這對情侶找了幾位朋友商量，一起安排結婚典禮。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-17","sourceFront":"商量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"她在嬰兒車上安裝了一排不同顏色的小燈，看起來很特別。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-15","sourceFront":"安裝","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"有時改變原來旅行的安排，可能會帶來不同的樂趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-38","sourceFront":"原來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"夏天到了，我們去海邊走走，順便去打個海灘排球。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-46","sourceFront":"排球","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一開始奧運僅安排男子比賽項目，後來才有女子項目的比賽。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-12","sourceFront":"男子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 扌(hand) takes the 非(fēi) ticket line → everyone must 排(line up)."},{"key":"[\"B4L10-1-05\",\"手術\",\"手術\",\"手术\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"根據手術的種類，病人在動手術前能吃的食物也不太相同。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-05","sourceFront":"手術","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"當外科醫生不容易，不僅要有手術的專業能力，體力也得夠好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-17","sourceFront":"外科","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"經過這次手術，得了重病的嬰兒終於順利地保住了生命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-32","sourceFront":"保","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"腦部血管很複雜，做腦部手術時不能有任何的差錯。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-24","sourceFront":"差錯","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L10-1-12\",\"药方\",\"藥方\",\"药方\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"現在去醫院拿藥，藥袋上都會把藥方及使用方式寫得很清楚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-12","sourceFront":"藥方","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L12-1-43\",\"工资\",\"工資\",\"工资\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"工會代表跟老闆討論工資問題，認為公司給的工錢仍然太低。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-45","sourceFront":"工錢","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-1-46\",\"與其\",\"與其\",\"与其\",\"Conj\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"A:你要不要跟我一起去茶館喝杯茶？ B:與其去喝茶，我倒想去外面走走，看看花草樹木。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-46","sourceFront":"與其","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"做生意與其花大錢廣告，不如提高品質，讓顧客替你宣傳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-27","sourceFront":"廣告","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L13-2-01\",\"是否\",\"是否\",\"是否\",\"Adv\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"她最近臉色都不好，我們是否該關心她一下？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-01","sourceFront":"是否","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L14-1-01\",\"高级\",\"高級\",\"高级\",\"N/Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他想等中文程度達到高級以後，就來臺灣念大學。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-01","sourceFront":"高級","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"他很聰明，成績又非常好，因此完成初級班的課程後，學校讓他跳過中級，到高級班學習，一連跳了兩級。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-04","sourceFront":"初級","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"巴德在華語能力測驗中得了86分，還拿到了華語高級證書，讓她開心了半天。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-35","sourceFront":"得分","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L15-1-35\",\"音量\",\"音量\",\"音量\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"手機鬧鐘的音量及音樂聲，都可按照個人的使用習慣來調整。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-35","sourceFront":"音量","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L15-1-37\",\"建築\",\"建築\",\"建筑\",\"N/V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"處理老房屋的問題，有時比重新建築一棟房子還要困難。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-37","sourceFront":"建築","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"初\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Cut the 衤(cloth) with a 刀(knife) to start sewing → 初(beginning)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"嘗試\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 嘗(taste) and 試(try): 嘗試 means try."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"姊妹\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 姊(elder sister) and 妹(younger sister): 姊妹 means sisters."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"帝\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 亠(lid) and 丷(horns) form the crown on the ruler's head; the 冖(cover) is the throne's canopy and 巾(cloth) hangs as his robes → 帝(supreme ruler)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"平時\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 平(flat) and 時(time): 平時 means normal times, at ordinary times."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"從不\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 從(from) and 不(not): 從不 means never."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"思\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 田(field) presses on a 心(heart) until the farmer works out his plan → 思(think)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"攝\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 扌(hand) scoops up a 聶(whisper) and absorbs every last word → 攝(absorb)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"毒品\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 毒(poison) and 品(article): 毒品 means drug."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"訝\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"A 言(speech) suddenly bites with a 牙(tooth) — you're 訝(amazed)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"謝\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 言(speech) takes a 射(shoot) straight to the heart → 謝(thank)."}]}
